{
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": { "type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --" },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Spend over time",
      "description": "USD cost of LLM calls, span-derived from ethos_llm_cost_usd_total. This is NOT the same number as `ethos usage` (message-derived) — see the caveat panel below.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "currencyUSD", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum by (personality) (max without (job) (rate(ethos_llm_cost_usd_total[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{personality}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tokens by personality/model",
      "description": "ethos_llm_tokens_total, summed over kind (input/output/cache_read/cache_creation). openai-compat transport always reports cacheReadTokens=0 in this phase (D22) — see the caveat panel.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum by (personality, model) (max without (job) (rate(ethos_llm_tokens_total[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{personality}} · {{model}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Top tools by count, duration, failure rate",
      "description": "No per-tool USD cost exists (only LLM calls carry estimatedCostUsd) — \"cost\" here is time-cost: average and p95 duration from ethos_tool_duration_seconds.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "custom": { "align": "auto" } },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Value #A" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "displayName", "value": "Calls" }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Value #B" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "displayName", "value": "Avg duration (s)" },
              { "id": "unit", "value": "s" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Value #C" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "displayName", "value": "p95 duration (s)" },
              { "id": "unit", "value": "s" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Value #D" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "displayName", "value": "Failure rate" },
              { "id": "unit", "value": "percentunit" }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": { "showHeader": true },
      "transformations": [{ "id": "merge", "options": {} }],
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum by (tool) (max without (job) (increase(ethos_tool_calls_total[$__range])))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum by (tool) (max without (job) (increase(ethos_tool_duration_seconds_sum[$__range]))) / sum by (tool) (max without (job) (increase(ethos_tool_duration_seconds_count[$__range])))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, tool) (max without (job) (increase(ethos_tool_duration_seconds_bucket[$__range]))))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum by (tool) (max without (job) (increase(ethos_tool_calls_total{outcome=\"error\"}[$__range]))) / sum by (tool) (max without (job) (increase(ethos_tool_calls_total[$__range])))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Outcome rates",
      "description": "ethos_turn_outcomes_total by status (completed/errored/halted).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum by (status) (max without (job) (rate(ethos_turn_outcomes_total[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Cache-hit rate",
      "description": "cache_read tokens as a share of cache_read + input. openai-compat transport always reports cacheReadTokens=0 in this phase (D22) — any model routed through it drags this down artificially. See the caveat panel.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum(max without (job) (rate(ethos_llm_tokens_total{kind=\"cache_read\"}[5m]))) / (sum(max without (job) (rate(ethos_llm_tokens_total{kind=\"cache_read\"}[5m]))) + sum(max without (job) (rate(ethos_llm_tokens_total{kind=\"input\"}[5m]))))",
          "legendFormat": "cache-hit rate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "LLM request latency (p95)",
      "description": "histogram_quantile(0.95, ethos_llm_request_duration_seconds_bucket) by model. Buckets fixed per D18: 0.25, 0.5, 1, 2, 4, 8, 16, 32, 64.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 16 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "s", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, model) (max without (job) (rate(ethos_llm_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m]))))",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tool duration (p95)",
      "description": "histogram_quantile(0.95, ethos_tool_duration_seconds_bucket) by tool. Buckets fixed per D18: 0.01, 0.05, 0.1, 0.25, 0.5, 1, 2.5, 5, 10, 30, 60.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 16 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "s", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, tool) (max without (job) (rate(ethos_tool_duration_seconds_bucket[5m]))))",
          "legendFormat": "{{tool}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Adapter health",
      "description": "ethos_gateway_adapter_up (1 = up, 0 = down/stale). Stale gateway heartbeat (>30s) reports 0.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 0, "fillOpacity": 70 },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": { "text": "down", "color": "red" },
                "1": { "text": "up", "color": "green" }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "showValue": "never" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "max by (adapter) (ethos_gateway_adapter_up)",
          "legendFormat": "{{adapter}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Unpriced LLM calls (caveat)",
      "description": "ethos_llm_unpriced_calls_total — calls with no known price. Read together with the text panel to the right.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 30 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum by (provider, model) (max without (job) (rate(ethos_llm_unpriced_calls_total[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}} · {{model}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Caveats — read before trusting a number on this dashboard",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 30 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**This dashboard is not the only source of spend numbers — and it is not complete.**\n\n1. **Prometheus spend here is span-derived; `ethos usage` (the CLI) is message-derived.** They read different tables (`observability.db` spans vs. `sessions.db` messages) and can diverge. Never treat them as the same number (D15).\n\n2. **`openai-compat` transport always reports `cacheReadTokens=0` in this phase.** Any model routed through OpenRouter, Ollama, Gemini-via-compat, or Anthropic-via-compat undercounts cache on the *Cache-hit rate* panel and undercounts cost savings on the *Spend* panel (D22). This is not a bug to file — it's a known Phase 2 limitation.\n\n3. **The chart to the left shows LLM calls with no known price**, not the total blind spot. Unattributed spend from approval reviewers, kanban verifiers, and eval scorers isn't captured by these metrics at all — see the plan's \"out of scope\" list."
      }
    }
  ],
  "preload": false,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["ethos", "observability"],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "current": { "text": "Prometheus", "value": "prometheus" },
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": false,
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "multi": false,
        "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
        "options": [],
        "query": "prometheus",
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "skipUrlSync": false,
        "type": "datasource"
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "Ethos Observability",
  "uid": "ethos-observability",
  "version": 1,
  "weekStart": ""
}
